<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) & Park et al. (2015) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming & asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions map to the Bi et al. (2015) vertex energy equation, and `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_045_vertex_glass_jamming.lean` proves 4 machine-checked theorems, but v1 docstrings lack equation-by-equation mappings to Bi et al. (2015) Figs. 2-4, Park et al. (2015) Figs. 1-4, and Atia et al. (2018) k-Gamma scaling." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L35–L122: Baseline functions lack detailed equation-number citations to T1 barrier scaling, asthma unjamming, and k-Gamma universality <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L35-L122>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-code-traceability-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) & Park et al. (2015) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming & asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition — Model fidelity to source: 67/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the Bi et al. (2015) Eq. (2) dimensionless single-cell vertex energy (`compute_cell_vertex_energy`, L35-50) and simulates periodic Voronoi cell packing below and above `p_0^* = 3.813` (`simulate_unjamming_v1`, L74-122). However, v1 omits the analytical T1 topological rearrangement barrier `Delta e_T1(p_0)` and static shear modulus `G(p_0)` scaling laws (Bi et al. 2015 Figs. 2-3), omits Park et al. (2015) human bronchial epithelial maturation and bronchospasm unjamming dynamics, and omits Atia et al. (2018) `k`-Gamma shape-index universality." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L74–L122: Baseline Voronoi simulation lacks explicit T1 barrier Delta e_T1(p0), shear modulus G(p0), and asthmatic bronchial maturation model <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L74-L122>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 6.7e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) & Park et al. (2015) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming & asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition — Morphometric validation: 53/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes 3 basic metrics (`solid_mean_shape_index_q`, `fluid_mean_shape_index_q`, `critical_shape_index_p0_star`, L185-204), but does not compare simulated `Delta e_T1(p_0)`, `G(p_0)`, or observed `<q>(p_0)` across an 8-point phase sweep against Bi et al. (2015) reference values, does not validate Park et al. (2015) Days 3-18 bronchial epithelial maturation curves, and does not extract empirical cell shape indices `q = P/sqrt(A)` from the biological specimen micrograph." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L185–L204: Only 3 summary metrics without Bi et al. (2015) phase-sweep correlation, Park et al. (2015) asthma timecourse validation, or specimen q distribution match <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L185-L204>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-measurement-critical-shape-index-p0-star>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-measurement-fluid-mean-shape-index-q>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-measurement-solid-mean-shape-index-q> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) & Park et al. (2015) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming & asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition — MorphoEval overall 54.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) evaluation of `2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py` (57.3/100). The v1 baseline implements the Bi et al. (2015) Nature Physics Eq. (2) dimensionless vertex energy `e = 0.5 * sum [(a_i - 1)^2 + r * (p_i - p_0)^2]` and simulates two points (`p_0 = 3.70` solid vs `p_0 = 3.95` fluid), but omits explicit T1 energy barrier `Delta e_T1(p_0)` and shear modulus `G(p_0)` scaling across `p_0^* = 3.813`, omits the Park et al. (2015) Nature Materials non-asthmatic vs. asthmatic human bronchial epithelium ALI maturation timecourse and bronchospasm compression perturbation, does not load or segment the vendored human monolayer micrograph (`human_epithelial_monolayer_specimen.jpg`), and exposes no CLI parameter flags beyond `--self-test`. Overall 54.2/100 (faithfulness 49.1, reproducibility 66.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0cb0132; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 67, Morphological realism / specimen match 34, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 53, Source and data traceability 63, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/vertex_glass_jamming_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py at 0cb0132, image/png, 157153 B, 1560×520 px, artifact_sha256 1b0d09c98454983bc345738c02733c122e65b9963a3d007878775ca67be4b6f5 (sha256 1b0d09c98454983bc345738c02733c122e65b9963a3d007878775ca67be4b6f5), spec_fingerprint 52abc2dcaa2857a7c9b54a7d8ac8d7ebb1e0481dc0dc957ca72fa6bc9190d466. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 52abc2dcaa2857a7c9b54a7d8ac8d7ebb1e0481dc0dc957ca72fa6bc9190d466; artifact_sha256: 1b0d09c98454983bc345738c02733c122e65b9963a3d007878775ca67be4b6f5." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement explicit T1 topological rearrangement energy barrier Delta e_T1(p_0) and static shear modulus G(p_0) scaling across an 8-point p_0 phase sweep spanning solid jammed (p_0 < 3.813) and fluid unjammed (p_0 >= 3.813) regimes, plus a perimeter-elasticity ablation control (r = 0).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/vertex_glass_jamming/vertex_glass_jamming_reference.json` and `human_epithelial_monolayer_specimen.jpg`, segment the dark junctional boundaries and blue nuclear seeds via watershed/Voronoi tessellation to extract empirical cell shape indices q = P/sqrt(A) and polygon classes P(n), and validate against the k-Gamma distribution.",
        "remediation needed: Model the Park et al. (2015) Nature Materials human bronchial epithelial cell (HBEC) air-liquid interface maturation timecourse (Days 3-18) for non-asthmatic control vs. asthmatic donors and 30 cm H2O mechanical bronchospasm compression, plus Atia et al. (2018) universal k-Gamma shape-index scaling." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.42e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) & Park et al. (2015) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming & asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition — Parameter expressivity: 45/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates only two discrete parameter points (`p_0 = 3.70` and `p_0 = 3.95`) without a continuous `p_0` phase sweep across the solid-to-fluid transition at `p_0^* = 3.813`, without comparing non-asthmatic control vs. asthmatic vs. mechanically compressed bronchial epithelium, without a zero-contractility / ablation control (`r = 0`), and without CLI flags for `--p0`, `--r`, `--steps`, or `--seed` (L214-218)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L128–L129: Only two p0 values (3.70 and 3.95) simulated in v1 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L128-L129>",
        "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py L214–L218: CLI parser only accepts --self-test <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py#L214-L218>" ;
    pk:hasScore 4.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-repro-package> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) & Park et al. (2015) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming & asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition — Reproducibility package: 68/100" ;
